If not listed kindly enter the risk data in risk table at QMS website<br>

4. If job order RPN &lt; 25 then concerned employee can proceed with the work as per the job order. However,
it is mandatory to created risk record at QMS website for job order RPn ≥ 25 for proceeding with this job order.<br>

5. Risk table and risk record can be viewed through this QMS Link: http://qms.ursc.dos.gov.in/iso/records/rsk-through-qms/</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

